    "final_report_title": "研究报告：Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器是在哪个版本引入、哪个版本稳定的，具体怎么声明？引用官方文档或发布说明。",
    "final_report_markdown": "# Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器：引入版本、稳定版本与声明方式\n\nKubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器（即可重启的 Init 容器）在 Kubernetes 1.28 中以 Alpha 引入，并在 v1.33 转为稳定（Stable）。它的声明方式是将容器列入 Pod 的 initContainers 字段，并对该容器设置 restartPolicy: Always（或按要求省略该字段）；该能力受 SidecarContainers 特性门控控制。\n\n## 直接回答\n\n本次核验的资料显示，可重启的 Init 容器（sidecar）是以 Alpha 形式在 Kubernetes 1.28 中引入的新特性。 [evidence:c952df1ee19b1e3675b95f48696f9e31eafeb33f1b3544c9]\n\n该 Sidecar 容器特性在 v1.33 转为稳定（Stable）。 [evidence:222d74d20ec9b48a0e4685619806b92616b1b8bff5153ada] [evidence:fec9d9179b4427c8cef8777d6bd959cef9db8344c16b2a33]\n\n声明方面，Kubernetes 将 sidecar 实现为带 restartPolicy: Always 的一类特殊 Init 容器；在集群启用 SidecarContainers 特性门控时，可以为 Pod 的 initContainers 字段中列出的容器指定 restartPolicy。对于 Init 容器，既可以省略 restartPolicy 字段，也可以将其设为 Always。 [evidence:1191594b96b4987bde4441188c07f1adda734ec7e02c80eb] [evidence:068495df970a72e9091df1e5f862314b6b0d5e6a0ef281a0] [evidence:7d1a7f034e8d3458851bfc58291abed05689ce4febd5047f]\n\n## 对比表\n\n| 维度 | 内容 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 引入版本 | 在 Kubernetes 1.28 中以 Alpha 引入 [evidence:c952df1ee19b1e3675b95f48696f9e31eafeb33f1b3544c9] |\n| 稳定版本 | 在 v1.33 转为稳定（Stable） [evidence:222d74d20ec9b48a0e4685619806b92616b1b8bff5153ada] [evidence:fec9d9179b4427c8cef8777d6bd959cef9db8344c16b2a33] |\n| 声明方法 | 在 SidecarContainers 特性门控启用时，为 Pod 的 initContainers 中列出的容器指定 restartPolicy；sidecar 即带 restartPolicy: Always 的特殊 Init 容器，Init 容器的 restartPolicy 可省略或设为 Always [evidence:1191594b96b4987bde4441188c07f1adda734ec7e02c80eb] [evidence:068495df970a72e9091df1e5f862314b6b0d5e6a0ef281a0] [evidence:7d1a7f034e8d3458851bfc58291abed05689ce4febd5047f] |\n\n## Citation audit\n\n### Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器 · 引入版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:c952df1ee19b1e3675b95f48696f9e31eafeb33f1b3544c9`\n- Exact quote: “This post explains how to use the new sidecar feature, which enables restartable init containers and is available in alpha in Kubernetes 1.28.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/988c7ef6de5301c73130796539ec31f7c9bdc3b4c85fae4c270b5b9b23d2aa97`\n- URL: https://kubernetes.io/blog/2023/08/25/native-sidecar-containers/\n\n### Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器 · 稳定版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:222d74d20ec9b48a0e4685619806b92616b1b8bff5153ada`\n- Exact quote: “`Kubernetes v1.33 [stable]`”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/84ce38346d9b1d2ae78bc7264cc05139ebdd4feae9d84918e2e2587a3f7a8ac0`\n- URL: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/sidecar-containers/\n\n### Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器 · 稳定版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:fec9d9179b4427c8cef8777d6bd959cef9db8344c16b2a33`\n- Exact quote: “Sidecar containers graduate to stable in v1.33.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/cd16db2a1bc32f2b9dfab24029cdb5cf26440b669065355137ac18594044ad61`\n- URL: https://kubernetes.io/blog/2025/04/23/kubernetes-v1-33-release/\n\n### Kubernetes 原生 Sidecar 容器 · 声明方法\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:1191594b96b4987bde4441188c07f1adda734ec7e02c80eb`\n- Exact quote: “you can specify a `restartPolicy`<br>for containers listed in a Pod's `initContainers` field.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/84ce38346d9b1d2ae78bc7264cc05139ebdd4feae9d84918e2e2587a3f7a8ac0`\n- URL: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/sidecar-containers/\n\n## 补充引用\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:068495df970a72e9091df1e5f862314b6b0d5e6a0ef281a0`\n  - Exact quote: “Kubernetes implements sidecars as a special class of init containers with `restartPolicy: Always`”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/cd16db2a1bc32f2b9dfab24029cdb5cf26440b669065355137ac18594044ad61`\n  - URL: https://kubernetes.io/blog/2025/04/23/kubernetes-v1-33-release/\n- Evidence: `evidence:7d1a7f034e8d3458851bfc58291abed05689ce4febd5047f`\n  - Exact quote: “For init containers, you can either omit the `restartPolicy` field, or set it to `Always`.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/d986e250-f88b-47b4-b036-e661b000c3fd/c1ff79ebaf20c7f2d79382ed22b174160b95f70e504beeffb39865e1d899ae41`\n  - URL: https://kubernetes.io/blog/2023/08/15/kubernetes-v1-28-release/\n",
